{"3887080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stufft TD", "steam_appid": 3887080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your average tower defense.<br>In this cartoon-styled sci-fi chaosfest, you build powerful <strong>multi-class turrets</strong> with active abilities, item slots, and evolving upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Explosions? Check.</strong><br>🌀 <strong>Status effects? Plenty.</strong><br>📈 <strong>Scaling madness? Absolutely.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turret has unique skills and can apply effects like <strong>Freeze</strong>, <strong>Fracture</strong>, <strong>Corrosion</strong>, or even <strong>Binding</strong>.<br>Use <strong>cooldowns strategically</strong>, stack <strong>crit chance</strong>, unlock powerful <strong>combo effects</strong>, and manipulate the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful—enemies adapt fast, and if your <strong>DPS falls short for too long</strong>, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Tactical solo gameplay with scaling challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Dozens of turrets with different stats, roles, and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Abilities that explode, ricochet, burn, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Item slot system for deep customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Critical hits, splash zones, and passive stacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 Final wave spike upgrades — go all in or fall behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 A sandbox of mechanics for creative builds and weird strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love experimenting, optimizing, and watching things go boom — this is for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p